  "content": "<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhoster24.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#00f;font-size:24px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/566412/description_22188d49-df21-4e21-ba83-cc6001713fa7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"96\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">隐藏<span style=\"color:#f90\">与</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#f90\">寻<span style=\"color:#f00\">找</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一款让你玩</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">捉迷藏的游戏地图</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 专为2-4名玩家设计</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\">为什么你应该下载这张地图</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 在3张大型地图上游玩（未来可能还会增加更多）</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 许多可供躲藏的地点</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 给予躲藏者充足的躲藏时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 我们仍在完善这张地图</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>发现bug怎么办</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您发现了bug，请留言或通过电子邮件 Lenny230809@gmail.com 联系我</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地图中有游戏模式吗</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地图中有2种游戏模式（普通模式 &amp; 方块模式）</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">普通模式：标准的捉迷藏玩法</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方块模式：标准的捉迷藏玩法，但可以使用方块</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>创作者</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- Play it now (指挥官)</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-&nbsp;lyfeyt2 (建造者)</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>计划中的更新</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可能增加超过3张地图</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/twhqbCfdDP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><strong>Discord</strong></span></a></span></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>此外，请查看我们的其他地图</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>预告片：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C1j6kkvrmvY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"788\" height=\"433\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
